Letters and accents: Unicode CLDR 49, exemplar characters. Unicode License v3. Copyright Unicode, Inc.

Typing: Wikimedia's jquery.ime, hi-transliteration (https://github.com/wikimedia/jquery.ime, rules/hi/hi-transliteration.js) by Junaid P V, GNU GPL 3.0.

Words: Hermit Dave's FrequencyWords (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, hi_full.txt), built from OpenSubtitles. Its content is CC BY-SA 4.0.

Next words (pairs.bin): counts of word pairs from the Leipzig Corpora Collection's hin_news_2022_1M (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0. D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart and U. Quasthoff: Building Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection: From 100 to 200 Languages. LREC 2012. Built by tools/im/next_words.py; only the counts of the most common word pairs are included.

Starters: the words that most often begin a sentence in the Leipzig Corpora Collection's hin_news_2022_1M (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0.

Blocked words (blocked.txt), never offered on the bar: LDNOOBW's List of Dirty, Naughty, Obscene and Otherwise Bad Words (hi, https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words), CC BY 4.0, with TitanKeys' own short list (tools/im/blocklist-extra.tsv).
